 Soul','No description available for this anime.','捕星司·源起',18,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-27','ja',NULL,'JP','Web novel',NULL,'ONA',NULL,1.2061303352740411,3,'2026-09-24',2,'2026-09-24 17:11:46','https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1383/136861.jpg');
